# claude: this fork never had a .gitignore at all - build outputs were
# neither tracked nor ignored (same gap as the sibling forks/rpi1 fork).
# Covers both the real-hardware build outputs (kernel7.bin/kernel.list/
# kernel.map/build/) and the additive QEMU-only ones (kernel7-qemu.bin/
# kernel-qemu.map). Root-anchored (leading "/") and by exact name,
# deliberately NOT a broad "*.bin"/"*.img" glob - source/font.bin/
# font1.bin are genuine checked-in binary assets (font bitmap data, not
# build output) and a recursive glob would have caught those too.
#
# source/fs.img WAS checked in here too, until 2026-09-09: it's the
# OUTPUT of uprogs/'s own separate build (mkfs + every UPROGS binary),
# and the top-level Makefile now regenerates it automatically on every
# build (see this Makefile's own "source/fs.img: FORCE" rule) rather
# than trusting a committed binary blob to stay in sync with
# uprogs/*.c - see notes_arch_arm_pi2.txt's own "Bug 11"/"Bug 12" for
# what that committed copy was already silently hiding (a stale build
# that no longer matched what uprogs/'s own source would produce).
/build/
/kernel7.bin
/kernel7-qemu.bin
/kernel.list
/kernel.map
/kernel-qemu.map
/kernel/fs.img
